  "id": "profile-analysis",
  "term": "profile analysis",
  "definition": "Profile analysis is an approach used to sort people in a population into subgroups, or profiles, based on patterns across measured characteristics such as behavior and psychosocial features. It is used to better understand differences within a group so care or support can be more closely matched to each profile’s needs.",
